  "novelty_justification": "The theorem-level advance is an if-and-only-if operator-injectivity frontier for recovering nonlinear mechanisms, an arbitrary dependent joint residual law, and all recursively support-closed hard-intervention distributions from a finite collection of known natural-value translations. Existing exact covers target Gaussian means under hard interventions, graphical calculi target query identification without additive inversion, and linear environment-shift methods target structure or coefficients through noise-distribution changes."
